WEBVTT

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:37.170
Where...

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.340
...am I?

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:42.210
I...

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.990
Who are you?

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:51.460
Me?

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:53.050
Where did you come from?

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:56.120
Where did I...

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.800
What's your name?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.100
My name?

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:04.910
My name is...

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.980
Chaos and Confusion

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.810
It survived!

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:27.850
I guess it's broken, after all.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.230
Ouch...

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.350
Sue.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.070
What are you doing?

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.800
We've been ordered on standby.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.820
I-I was just looking for a radio.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.780
And I found one, but it was busted.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:25.010
Then I thought I could
maybe find parts to fix it...

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.310
Somehow, I ended up helping...

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:29.870
Resting is also our job.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.080
I know, but I just...

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:38.360
Besides, do you think you've got
a magic wand to fix all this junk?

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:41.090
Well, I don't have a magic wand...

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:47.770
But I have hands and feet I can use freely.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.270
I understand how you feel, but...

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.670
But, but, but...

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:56.980
Lt. Green, you're always over-thinking things.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:00.880
What's the problem?

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.010
What's wrong?

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.950
That's my line.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:05.110
I was...

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:08.060
I came here without really thinking it through.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.120
It seems this is the only place I feel at home.

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:15.830
I can't rest until home
sweet home is in order again.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.750
Home sweet home?

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:21.340
When your home's messed up,
you have to fix it, right?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.910
Mr. Fairy's been asleep a long time.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:56.960
But he will wake up, right?

00:05:58.670 --> 00:05:59.670
Yeah.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:04.280
Mr. Fairy, hurry up and wake up!

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:07.390
Everyone's waiting for you to wake up!

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:10.350
We need you to watch over our home!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.380
Here, is this okay?

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:15.980
Look, you've got to get that
connector changed soon.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:17.770
Saying that won't get it done.

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:20.330
We don't have the replacement parts.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.050
Should you be up and around so soon?

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.120
I can't sit still and do nothing.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:55.190
I just walked around the base.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:07:00.610
I guess I owe you again.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:08.910
It seems we might somehow be
able to fix the first runway tonight.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:11.740
Hopefully, it'll ease
the transportation needs.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.150
What about the SARGs?

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:17.410
All but SARG 5 had to be
sent back to special forces.

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:20.800
They were too damaged to fix on-site.

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:23.460
So we've only got one SARG.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:27.990
We're done for if another alien attacks.

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.830
But this has given the troops time to rest.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.110
By the runway.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:52.480
What are they doing?

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:54.260
They gathered there themselves.

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:57.960
They probably couldn't sit
around and do nothing either.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:00.750
Shall I stop them?

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.120
No.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:08.470
I think I'll go back and help out, too.

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:31.750
Maki...

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:32.870
What are you doing?

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:36.590
I've found someone else to take care of.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:39.050
Maki, get away from him!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.700
I can't hide from my feelings.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.710
Get away, Maki!

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.140
Get back!

00:09:58.210 --> 00:09:59.240
What do you want?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:05.310
I haven't heard from my loved
one lately, so I'm a little on edge.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:06.760
I gave up on that.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:10.690
Well, well, you're in a very bad mood today.

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:15.590
As you wished, the EX-1 is asleep.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:20.030
In your mind, your
long-awaited moment has come...

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:22.970
...so I thought you'd be celebrating.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.410
What do you know about me?

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.370
Don't misunderstand me.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:34.080
I just want to make sure that the
spite in your heart goes on forever.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:40.380
A saint-like woman who can't be
described in any kind of words.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.890
Who represents all of your youth.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:45.480
Am I wrong?

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:53.530
The curtain's just opening
on the second act.

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.700
Don't think your curse is gone.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:57.760
No, maybe it's forever...

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.000
It'll never go away.

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:02.820
And if you try to deny that simple fact...

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.510
Then what?

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:17.620
Excuse me.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.420
I was just going to eat it.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.400
But I'm not worried about you.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:35.270
You'll keep your end of the bargain.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.400
You know why?

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:29.030
Frank...

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.260
You...

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:37.540
Move the EX-1?

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:39.530
That's right.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:45.840
We were able to repair the EX-1's
body in 178 hours as planned.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.470
But he won't wake.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:49.610
Are you saying he's comatose?

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:52.650
Basically, yes.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:56.020
So we forcibly connect cables
and jump-start his engines?

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:58.360
We don't know what method they'll use.

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:02.650
I'm told they've built
a new facility for reviving him.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:05.870
If that's the case...

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.830
I need someone to take escort duty.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.470
I'd like to volunteer.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.510
My SARG is the only one still functioning.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:33.120
Is Mr. Fairy going to be okay?

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.650
He's on his way to a big hospital.

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.720
They'll take good care of him.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:57.050
What's my final destination?

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:59.250
We haven't been told ourselves.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:03.880
The place is classified Level-A security.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:06.660
Just follow the transport pilot.

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:07.550
Roger.

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:45.570
Is Ryu going to be all right on his own?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.240
Hey, when did you start
calling him by his first name?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.470
Me?

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:52.670
Lt. Soma?

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.640
Yes, it sounded like you're old friends.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:59.480
No, I didn't mean it like that.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:03.050
I meant can we trust him with the EX-1?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.740
He hates the EX-1.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.510
What makes you say-

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.620
Just a feeling.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:16.290
He sure seems to affect you, doesn't he?

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:17.990
What's that mean?

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:20.640
Getting upset makes it more suspicious.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.070
Hey, hey, hey.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.590
Quit kidding around!

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:31.540
I-It's fixed!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.450
Transport plane to SARG 5.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:46.120
Ascend to 2000 altitude
and follow the guide beacon.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.420
Roger.

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.020
Unknown object approaching.

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:07.040
What is it?

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:11.060
Does anything show on your radar?

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.180
Nothing here.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:16.960
There it is.

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:28.240
First engine's been shot! Back up?

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.410
Back up?

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:30.630
Requested.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:32.330
But we can still fly.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.040
Can you reach the destination?

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:36.200
We'll be there in 10 minutes.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:38.300
We'll manage for 10 minutes.

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.670
I saw a flash!

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:41.770
Damn.

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.260
Mr. Fairy!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.610
A new alien?

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.440
Is he after the EX-1?

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:13.720
A dead copy?

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.790
This can't mean...

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.200
Th-This is a SARG!

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:46.500
Who's in there?

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:32.650
This is...

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:36.960
...the end.

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:41.590
What the hell? A shot from
behind didn't faze him?

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.910
I won't let you kill him!

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.090
Did he switch off his limiter?

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:49.950
The only way to beat him is if I also...

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:43.950
You're just like the pilot of SARG 2...

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.160
SARG 5, please report.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:30.340
SARG 5, do you copy?

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:33.130
The transport plane arrived safely.

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:36.870
Repeat, SARG 5, please respond!

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:57.260
Th-This is...

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:21.720
Am I...

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:23.820
...dreaming?

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:40.730
There is a reason for
a bad dream to continue.

00:22:40.730 --> 00:22:43.080
The cursed voice sings on.

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:45.350
And the grave comes alive again.

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:49.450
Next time,
Confusion and Answers.
